#. ~ Help menu
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid "Mind Over Matter: Basics"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Basics"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"Welcome to Mind Over Matter, a psychic powers mod for Cataclysm.  This mod "
"adds psionics to the game based on classical concepts of mental powers.  "
"Incinerate zombies as a pyrokinetic, avoid bullets by peering into the near "
"future as a clairsentient, recharge your car as an electrokinetic, run so "
"fast you can run on water as a biokinetic, and more.  All these powers are "
"available to you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Basics"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid "And to your enemies.  The player is not the only one with psionics."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Basics"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"Psionics are different in several ways than the magical powers in Magiclysm."
"  For one, all psionics require stamina to use rather than an external "
"resource such as mana, meaning a full-charged psion is only a short breather "
"away.  Second, psionic powers scale with your intelligence stat and with your"
" Nether Attunement (q.v.) as well as with the power level; this includes "
"their maximum possible level, which is equal to your intelligence times 1.5."
"  Third, long-duration powers must be concentrated on to be maintained, and "
"negative effects like being injured, being electrocuted, or inhaling toxic "
"smoke can cause you to lose your concentration.  Lose your concentration when"
" you're levitating or maintaining a pyrokinetic shield against fire and "
"you're in for a world of hurt and possibly the character creation screen."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Basics"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"Finally, psionics are taxing on the body and each usage of a power requires "
"caloric expenditure.  This is treated the same as any other caloric "
"expenditure, causing weariness when it grows large enough and eventually "
"rendering you exhausted.  Psionics are work."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Basics"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"Mind Over Matter is designed to be as congruent with vanilla as possible, so "
"psionics are rare and most evidence of their existence is confined to secret "
"locations.  It may take some time to gain psionic powers if you start without"
" them.  This is intended."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Basics"
#. ~ Help message in menu "Xedra Evolved: Basics"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/help_file.json
msgid ""
"One last thing: remember to bind the Supernatural Powers key to use your "
"powers!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help menu
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid "Mind Over Matter: Types of Psionics"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Types of Psionics"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid "There are nine paths of psionics in Mind over Matter, as follows:"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Types of Psionics"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"1) Biokinesis: Control over physical bodily processes such as respiration, "
"metabolism, skin elasticity, or pain response.  Master biokinetics can be "
"stronger or faster than any human can hope to be, cross short distances in "
"the blink of an eye, turn bolts or pull up nails using only their hands, hold"
" their breath for tens of minutes, and surpass the human pinnacle in every "
"realm of unarmed combat."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Types of Psionics"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"2) Clairsentience: Enhanced perception and use of senses beyond the physical "
"and short-term precognition, such as hearing high or low frequencies or "
"seeing through walls or to distant places.  Master clairsentients can predict"
" opponents' movements in combat, account for all possible effects on their "
"ranged weapons to make the perfect shot, have visions of nearby places, and "
"sense danger and those who try to harm them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Types of Psionics"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"3) Electrokinesis: Control over electricity and some electrochemical "
"processes, including the function of neurons and computers.  Master "
"electrokinetics can shock opponents by touch, recharge electronics on their "
"person, stun or shut down robots, paralyze beings with a nervous system, "
"speed up their own neural processes or those of others, and unleash blasts of"
" lightning."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Types of Psionics"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"4) Photokinesis: Control over light, radiation, and radio waves.  Master "
"photokinetics can cause the nearby air to glow, create illusions around "
"themselves to hide their position or even disappear, change their appearance,"
" unleash laser blasts, listen to radio broadcasts, and glow as brightly as "
"the noonday sun."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Types of Psionics"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"5) Pyrokinesis: Control over heat and fire.  Master pyrokinetics can wear a "
"light t-shirt in a blizzard, light wood with just a thought, unleash blasts "
"of flame on their enemies, surround themselves with a curtain of flame, and "
"heat up a location hot enough to metal steel."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Types of Psionics"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"6) Telekinesis: Moving objects without touching them.  Master telekinetics "
"can throw objects or people through the air, walk on water, create a barrier "
"that inhibits fast-moving attacks, carry an object next to them without "
"touching it, fly, or even cause small earthquakes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Types of Psionics"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"7) Telepathy: Perception and manipulation of others' thoughts.  Master "
"telepaths can read minds, influence others' moods to calm them down, tame "
"even normally-untameable animals, stun and damage enemies with mental "
"feedback, erase their perceptions from their targets' minds, and even take "
"control of their enemies and make them fight for the psion."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Types of Psionics"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"8) Teleportation: Movement without crossing the intervening distance.  Master"
" teleporters can increase the relative distances around their enemies to slow"
" their movements, reduce the relative distances around themselves to make "
"melee attacks from several meters away, teleport through walls or from the "
"first floor to the roof, walk through walls, travel long distances to places "
"they have previously been, and open temporary rifts into the Nether."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Types of Psionics"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"9) Vitakinesis: Control of health and vitality, such as bloodflow, "
"susceptibility to disease, healing speed, and need for sleep.  Master "
"vitakinesis can slow or staunch bloodflow, increase the recovery rate of "
"either a particular location or of their whole body, meditate instead of "
"sleep, purge themselves of toxins or diseases, disrupt the bodily functions "
"of their enemies, and heal grievous wounds in minutes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help menu
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid "Mind Over Matter: Gaining Psionic Powers"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Gaining Psionic Powers"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"There are three main ways to gain psionic powers: start the game with them, "
"find and use a matrix crystal, or exposure yourself to the raging energies of"
" a portal storm."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Gaining Psionic Powers"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"The first and most obvious is start the game with them.  There are "
"professions for each psionic path, such as \"Doomseer\" for clairsentience or"
" \"Itzcuauhtli Corps Liaison, Yohualli Ehēcatl Division\" for teleportation, "
"and each path also has a series of three backgrounds entitled Newly-Awakened,"
" Arising, and Ascended.  Newly-Awakened starts you with the absolute minimum "
"possible, only a couple powers.  Arising starts you with a good amount of "
"powers, equivalent to a mid-game character.  Ascended starts you with a very "
"powerful suite of psionics best suited for games where monster difficulty has"
" been significantly increased or other challenges are at play."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Gaining Psionic Powers"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"You can also choose psychic knacks; see its own help topic for a full "
"explanation."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Gaining Psionic Powers"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"The second is to find one of the strange colored crystals now found in the "
"world, and the third is to stand out in a portal storm unprotected.  Using a "
"matrix crystal works immediately and standing in a portal storm is a small "
"chance each moment, but the effect is the same.  If you succeed, you gain a "
"power path appropriate to the type of crystal, or randomly in the case of a "
"portal storm.  If you fail, you suffer from negative effects related to your "
"failure.  A failed biokinetic awakening will leave you physically weakened, "
"for example, and a failed telekinetic awakening causes unseen forces to press"
" down and inhibit your movement."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Gaining Psionic Powers"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Unlike learning spells, psionics are not guaranteed.  Each newly-created "
"character has only a chance to gain powers.  This chance is variable per "
"character, set when your character is created, and can range from 50% to as "
"little as 1%.  Furthermore, every path you learn decreases your odds to learn"
" future paths, though it never becomes impossible.  You may take the Latent "
"Psion trait at character creation to ensure that your first attempt to awaken"
" psionic powers is always successful, but this does affect the diminishing "
"returns of attempting to awaken additional paths.  You do not need to take "
"this trait if you start the game with any type of psionic powers; starting "
"psions are assumed to have been latent."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help menu
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid "Mind Over Matter: Using Psionic Powers"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Using Psionic Powers"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"Psionic powers are located in your supernatural powers menu, categorized by "
"path.  Each psionic power is preceded by a [Ψ]."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Using Psionic Powers"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Powers have a chance to fail based on a number of factors.  The most "
"important by far is your Metaphysics skill vs. the power's Difficulty, and "
"the chance of failure is also reduced by our intelligence and, to a much "
"lesser extent, the power's level.  It is increased by having a high Nether "
"Attunement, by channeling several powers in short succession, and by having "
"lower weariness levels (Moderate or below). Your chance of success is capped "
"based on whether you have the concentration proficiencies or not; only with "
"Concentration (Master) can you reach 100% chance to succeed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Using Psionic Powers"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"Psionic powers require stamina to fuel them, as well as calories.  The amount"
" of stamina is listed in the supernatural powers screen.  The calorie cost is"
" not, but scales with the Difficulty of the power.  This calorie cost is "
"treated the same as calories burned through exertion in all respects; they "
"can be tracked with an exercise band and their expenditure will make you more"
" weary.  Increasing the level of a particular power will reduce the stamina "
"cost but it will not reduce the calorie cost."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help menu
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid "Mind Over Matter: Improving and Learning New Powers"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Improving and Learning New Powers"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"Psionics come from within and cannot be studied by rote repetition from a "
"book.  Furthermore, since they only recently appeared with the Cataclysm, "
"there are no established teaching methods or pre-existing courses.  That "
"means that each psion must figure out how to use their powers themselves."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Improving and Learning New Powers"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"Every 12 to 168 hours, you gain insight and become eligible to learn a new "
"power, but that doesn't mean you automatically learn one.  Powers in paths "
"you have access to periodically check to see if they are eligible for "
"learning.  This requires insight as well as individual prerequisites that "
"must be met for each power, though there is always a small chance you will "
"have a flash of inspiration and discover a power despite not meeting the "
"prerequisites."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Improving and Learning New Powers"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"Once you discover a power, you need to study it and attempt to figure out how"
" to use it.  This is done by crafting its contemplation recipe, found in the "
"Metaphysics tab of the Practice crafting section.  This is a long craft "
"(usually from 8-16 hours) that must all be done in a single sitting and ends "
"with a contested roll of your Metaphysics skill + 1-10 against the power's "
"difficulty + 4.  If you succeed, you learn the power.  If you fail, you can "
"try again."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Improving and Learning New Powers"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"Once you know a power, that same contemplation recipe can be used to improve "
"it.  Simply craft the contemplation recipe and you will begin meditating on "
"the power.  The longer you meditate, the more experience in the power you "
"gain.  You can meditate as long as you want and stop at any time."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Improving and Learning New Powers"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"In order to focus enough, you will need a matrix crystal, either a drained "
"one or one attuned to the path.  The large crystal structures found out in "
"the world are also sufficient, though meditating near them for too long may "
"have unexpected effects."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Improving and Learning New Powers"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"One final important note.  Since insight is singular and used up by the first"
" power you learn, knowing more paths means that you will advance in any "
"individual path slower, since more powers are checking to see if they meet "
"the prerequisites to be learned and lower-difficulty powers check more often "
"than higher-difficulty ones.  Too many paths and it will take you months or "
"years to master a single one."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help menu
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid "Mind Over Matter: Concentration"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Concentration"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"One major difference in Mind Over Matter compared to other mods containing "
"supernatural effects is the concentration system.  By default, psionic powers"
" have no inherent duration; you cannot channel Physical Enhancement and then "
"have it sustain itself the way you could a Bless spell.  You must concentrate"
" on it to maintain it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Concentration"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"Concentration powers have a listed duration, but they keep going until turned"
" off or until your concentration is disrupted.  Every time the duration on a "
"concentration power is up, you gain additional experience in the power, check"
" for gain of Nether Attunement, and pay the caloric cost.  This is also when "
"checks to maintain concentration are made."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Concentration"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"By default you can only concentrate on a small number of powers at once, "
"equal to your intelligence divided by four.  While you can concentrate on "
"more powers than this in emergencies, you have a chance of losing your "
"concentration, and the effects of your powers, that scales with how many "
"powers you are over your limit.  A series of proficiencies exist that can "
"raise this limit, as can other traits.  In addition, many traits or temporary"
" effects can also lower it, such as being set on fire, nauseated, sick, too "
"hot or too cold, having an animalistic predatory mindset due to mutation, and"
" other conditions that would make it more difficult to concentrate "
"effectively.  Some circumstances, such as falling sleep or breaking a limb, "
"will automatically end concentration as well."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Concentration"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"As a psion you are not limited by mana but must carefully decide which powers"
" are appropriate for any particular situation you find yourself in, since you"
" cannot have them all on at once."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help menu
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid "Mind Over Matter: Nether Attunement"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Nether Attunement"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"Stamina and concentration are not the only limitations on your powers.  "
"Another is Nether Attunement, though it is both a limitation and a path to "
"power."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Nether Attunement"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"Psionics is the psychoactive power of the Nether channeled by careful "
"concentration.  Repeated use of psionics in a short period of time opens the "
"connection to the Nether wider, increasing the amount of power available.  "
"Higher levels of Nether Attunement boost all characteristics of your powers: "
"range, damage, duration, targets affected, bonus granted or penalty caused, "
"and so on.  At 12, the maximum degree of Nether Attunement, your powers are "
"over five times stronger than with no Nether Attunement!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Nether Attunement"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"Nether Attunement has a chance to rise when using any power or when "
"maintaining concentration on a power.  Higher-difficulty powers have a "
"greater chance of causing Nether Attunement, and using more powers in quick "
"succession also raises the chance."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Nether Attunement"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"However, Nether Attunement also carries risks.  The stronger your connection "
"to the Nether, the more likely that a single stray thought or momentary lapse"
" in concentration causes a disruption in your powers.  This is reflected in a"
" chance of backlash starting at Nether Attunement level 1.  At low levels of "
"Nether Attunement, backlashes are rare and minor: a headache, a nosebleed, or"
" a chill in the air.  They get more serious as your Nether Attunement rises, "
"including muscle weakness, temporarily losing access to your powers, or "
"uncontrollably-increasing Nether Attunement, finally reaching catastrophes "
"like eldritch monstrosities hunting you, an explosion of unearthly lightning,"
" or permanent psychological damage."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Nether Attunement"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"Nether Attunement is thus a balance between raising it to increase the "
"effectiveness of your powers and not wanting it to go too high to avoid a "
"backlash at an inopportune or dangerous moment."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Nether Attunement"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"Nether Attunement naturally lowers with time, and other methods exist of "
"lowering it as well."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help menu
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid "Mind Over Matter: Psychic Knacks"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Psychic Knacks"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"Psychic knacks are another way of starting the game with psionic powers, but "
"in a different way than awakenings.  Awakenings are artificial, induced by "
"matrix crystals or portal storms, but knacks are innate.  Someone with a "
"knack was born with their powers, though they probably didn't fully gain them"
" until later in life."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Psychic Knacks"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"Psychic knacks are meant to represent the kind of psychics that often show up"
" in horror literature, who are born with a certain set of powers and might "
"get better at them but rarely laterally branch out.  They are meant to "
"represent characters with one or a small number of tricks they can use to "
"their advantage.  In exchange, psychic knacks are one-half the Difficulty "
"that the full psionic power is, making them both easier to use and less "
"subject to Nether Attunement."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Psychic Knacks"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"Each knack is self contained.  A knack for Chameleoflage allows the psychic "
"to blend into their surroundings, and a knack for Mind Sense allows the "
"psychic to locate nearby minds, and *that's it*.  They are not a full "
"photokinetic or telepath and they will not gain any new powers.  What's more,"
" something about knacks seems to interfere with matrix and portal awakenings."
"  The more knacks a character has, the harder awakening as a psion will be.  "
"However, if you do awaken, any appropriate knacks are converted over into "
"powers in your path (if applicable) and you become eligible for learning new "
"powers."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Help message in menu "Mind Over Matter: Psychic Knacks"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/help_files.json
msgid ""
"Not every path has knacks available, and not every power can be taken as a "
"knack.  Knacks can only be taken during character creation.  If you take a "
"knack, you cannot start as a Latent Psion."
msgstr ""

