" you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  Moving things at "
"a distance is child's play.  You can pick up zombies and fling them away from"
" you, shatter doors with a thought, and jump from the fifth story and land "
"with barely a bruise.  Nothing is going to get close to you now."
