msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now"
" you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  The crazies were "
"bad enough during the riots, but once you were stopped by a police officer "
"whose bloodshot eyes told you that he wasn't going to let you off with a "
"warning.  But you could somehow hear his thoughts, a chaotic jumble of rage "
"and hunger and fear, you just…nudged them a little bit, and he wandered off "
"and left you alone.  It doesn't work the same way with the zombies, but you "
"can't have everything."
msgstr ""

