msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now"
" you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  Controlling human"
" minds is still too hard but at this point, animal minds are child's play.  A"
" while back, some kind of mutated wolf or dog or something jumped you in the "
"forest and after a few seconds, it was wagging its tail and jumping around "
"like a new puppy.  You wish you still had it with you, but it died fighting "
"off some kind of pink crustacean…thing, giving you time to run.  The bravest "
"dog you ever had."
msgstr ""

