#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now"
" you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You can step "
"through walls, and once you were surrounded by a horde and looked up and a "
"nearby rooftop and… there you were, safe and out of the zombies' line of "
"sight.  The rule of the zombie apocalypse is \"keep moving\", and you're the "
"best you've ever been at that."
msgstr ""

