msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now"
" you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  No wall or door "
"is a barrier to you and sometimes when you close your eyes you can travel to "
"places you've already been.  Once you were surprised by a bandit and when he "
"leveled his gun at you, you wished he was somewhere else and he "
"just…disappeared.  Nothing can keep you down now."
msgstr ""

