msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now"
" you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You broke your "
"leg when you got caught in a riot, and when things got really bad you were "
"positive you were going to die.  But somehow, after only a few days your leg "
"didn't seem to hurt nearly as much anymore.  By the end of the week you could"
" walk on it, and by now it's like nothing ever happened.  It's not going to "
"help you fight the zombies but it'll sure help you recover afterward."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
