msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Ascended Vitakinetic" for male
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now"
" you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You've suffered "
"injuries that should have killed you multiple times over by now and recovered"
" in days every time.  You've broken your leg twice, your arm once, drank bad "
"water that had you puking your guts out, nearly been disemboweled by some "
"mutated thing…every single time, your powers kept you going.  Hopefully "
"they'll see you through to the very end of all this."
msgstr ""

