msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm you always had a hidden reserve of power when you needed"
" it, and that ability has been greatly heightened after the world ended.  "
"While you are not a fully awakened psion, you have a single trick you can "
"use.  Hopefully it helps you survive."
msgstr ""

